## Exercise 8 — single tap or double

Edit `ex8/solution.tsx`. `TapTarget({ onSingle, onDouble })` renders a button
named `Tap`. One click calls `onSingle` 250ms later. A second click inside that
window calls `onDouble` once instead, and `onSingle` never. Unmounting while a
tap is pending must call neither.

